# .agentsignore - AI Agent 检索与 Token 降噪排除规则
# 匹配本规则的文件与目录将被 AI 代理搜索、索引及列举工具自动忽略，防止上下文污染与 Token 浪费。

# --- 系统与临时文件 ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/tmp/
**/.temp/

# --- 敏感凭据与本地环境变量 ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
secrets.properties

# --- 依赖库缓存 ---
**/node_modules/
**/Pods/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/vendor/

# --- 构建产物与打包输出 ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/target/

# --- iOS / macOS 构建产物与 Xcode 状态 ---
**/DerivedData/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/Assets.xcassets/
**/*.storekit

# --- Android 构建产物 ---
**/.gradle/
**/captures/

# --- 模型权重与二进制大数据 ---
**/*.gguf
**/*.bin
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.zip
